    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_AhBr0vmsYizpXmeS",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Lio is the flavored air diffuser that makes quitting <strong>simple and enjoyable</strong>. Relief cravings and keep your hand-to-mouth habit—<strong>anytime, anywhere—without nicotine, vapor, or smoke.</strong></h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_1RYE2RkaHWvSpmAK",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>SHIPPING &amp; DELIVERY</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_rsQPTDKzTj3ov1sZ",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3></h3><ul><li><h3><strong>Benelux:</strong> 1-2 business days</h3></li><li><h3><strong>Europe (outside Benelux):</strong> 2-4 business days</h3></li><li><h3><strong>Outside Europe:</strong> 5-7 business days</h3></li><li><h3><strong>Middle East (outside UAE):</strong> 2-3 business days</h3></li></ul><h3></h3><h3><strong>Free shipping</strong> on orders over €39.</h3><h3></h3><h3>Your order will be processed within 5 hours and shipped from our fulfilment center.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_TEAVz2fYFIZA1LaF",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>After two years of hard work, countless improvements, and valuable user feedback, we’re proud to introduce the Lio® Gen 2—a more practical and enjoyable solution.</h3><h3>Unlike the Lio Classic, the Lio® Gen 2 is easier to clean, allowing you to fully savor the flavors.</h3><h3>It also features an adjustable airflow, so you can customize the draw resistance to your liking. You can even close it completely, making your Cores last longer!</h3><h3>And no more fraying the Cores! The Lio® Gen 2 Cores are hollow, meaning no more messy fingers!</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_7NHYjUfj34yrNhTE",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>IS LIO® SAFE?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_l0RA30fPDXyULZYr",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3><strong>Safety first, always</strong>! Every natural plant compound in our products goes through serious third-party testing. These tests (plus a bunch of studies) prove that what you&apos;re inhaling is <strong>safe and effective</strong>. We&apos;re all about research to make sure you get a reliable, natural, non-electric option that keeps you healthy without skimping on safety or results.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_iaDMHwytWOZn6iSn",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>WHAT&apos;S IN A STARTERPACK?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_GmU6zQiK0lYmIK7y",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Sicherheit geht immer vor! Jeder natürliche Pflanzenextrakt in unseren Produkten wird strengen Tests durch Dritte unterzogen. Diese Tests (und zahlreiche Studien) beweisen, dass das, was Sie inhalieren, sicher und wirksam ist. Wir engagieren uns in der Forschung, um sicherzustellen, dass Sie eine zuverlässige, natürliche, nicht elektrische Option erhalten, die Sie gesund hält, ohne Kompromisse bei Sicherheit oder Ergebnissen einzugehen.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_bU6NbCZx7lodByXi",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>DIFFERENCE CLASSIC &amp; GEN 2 </h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_A7gyr6DDj9HJfDcA",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>After two years of hard work, countless improvements, and valuable user feedback, we’re proud to introduce the Lio® Gen 2—a more practical and enjoyable solution.</h3><h3>Unlike the Lio Classic, the Lio® Gen 2 is easier to clean, allowing you to fully savor the flavors.</h3><h3>It also features an adjustable airflow, so you can customize the draw resistance to your liking. You can even close it completely, making your Cores last longer!</h3><h3>And no more fraying the Cores! The Lio® Gen 2 Cores are hollow, meaning no more messy fingers!</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_4Kqumk0rvSJNBqMb",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Are the ingredients natural?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_BSGpLbcz4iEvYaPf",
      "label": "Text",
