        "text_TEAVz2fYFIZA1LaF": "<h3>After two years of hard work, countless improvements, and valuable user feedback, we’re proud to introduce the Lio® Gen 2—a more practical and enjoyable solution.</h3><h3>Unlike the Lio Classic, the Lio® Gen 2 is easier to clean, allowing you to fully savor the flavors.</h3><h3>It also features an adjustable airflow, so you can customize the draw resistance to your liking. You can even close it completely, making your Cores last longer!</h3><h3>And no more fraying the Cores! The Lio® Gen 2 Cores are hollow, meaning no more messy fingers!</h3>",
