        "text_gEWPldWMeVrwUsbI": "<h3></h3><ul><li><h3><strong>Benelux:</strong> 1-2 business days</h3></li><li><h3><strong>Europe (outside Benelux):</strong> 2-4 business days</h3></li><li><h3><strong>Outside Europe:</strong> 5-7 business days</h3></li><li><h3><strong>Middle East (outside UAE):</strong> 2-3 business days</h3></li></ul><h3></h3><h3><strong>Free shipping</strong> on orders over €39.</h3><h3></h3><h3>Your order will be processed within 5 hours and shipped from our fulfilment center.</h3>",
        "text_Zvrep9DKBPR2sixZ": "<h3>Lio® is free from nicotine, chemicals, and harmful substances, making it a natural, non-electric option. Since it contains no intoxicants or prohibited ingredients, <strong>Lio® aligns with Halal practices</strong>. However, always consult with a religious authority if you have concerns.</h3>",
