        "text_8hI9PrJxLGUlTobz": "<h3><strong>Safety first, always</strong>! Every natural plant compound in our products goes through serious third-party testing. These tests (plus a bunch of studies) prove that what you&apos;re inhaling is <strong>safe and effective</strong>. We&apos;re all about research to make sure you get a reliable, natural, non-electric option that keeps you healthy without skimping on safety or results.</h3>",
